          "message": {
            "text": "The test exhaustively compares all Unicode scalars with the generated ranges and pins the member count plus packed-endpoint SHA-256. Focused property/stage tests passed 8/8, the live vertical and text-combine browser control passed, and typecheck/lint passed.",
            "markdown": "The test exhaustively compares all Unicode scalars with the generated ranges and pins the member count plus packed-endpoint SHA-256. Focused property/stage tests passed 8/8, the live vertical and text-combine browser control passed, and typecheck/lint passed."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/script/vertical-orientation.generated.test.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 10,
                  "endLine": 28,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "describe(\"Chromium-pinned ICU mixed vertical orientation\", () => {\n  it(\"matches every scalar and the packed property digest\", () => {\n    let index = 0;\n    let members = 0;\n    for (let cp = 0; cp <= 0x10ffff; cp++) {\n      while (index < MIXED_VERTICAL_UPRIGHT_RANGES.length && cp > MIXED_VERTICAL_UPRIGHT_RANGES[index][1]) index++;\n      const range = MIXED_VERTICAL_UPRIGHT_RANGES[index];\n      const expected = range != null && cp >= range[0] && cp <= range[1];\n      if (expected) members++;\n      expect(isMixedVerticalUpright(cp)).toBe(expected);\n    }\n    const packed = Buffer.allocUnsafe(MIXED_VERTICAL_UPRIGHT_RANGES.length * 8);\n    MIXED_VERTICAL_UPRIGHT_RANGES.forEach(([lo, hi], i) => {\n      packed.writeUInt32LE(lo, i * 8);\n      packed.writeUInt32LE(hi, i * 8 + 4);\n    });\n    expect(members).toBe(MIXED_VERTICAL_UPRIGHT_MEMBER_COUNT);\n    expect(createHash(\"sha256\").update(packed).digest(\"hex\")).toBe(MIXED_VERTICAL_UPRIGHT_SHA256);\n  });"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
